# The Hypster at audio rate on both outs; GAIN down + DAMP up stops it;
# GAIN/DAMP back plus a kick (B3 + B1) restarts it.
# (A pot takes over only once it crosses the stored value, so each move
# sweeps 1 -> 0 first.)
wait 2500
# Filter page: OUT L and OUT R to X (the first option)
tap b2
wait 300
pot 5 1
pot 6 1
wait 300
pot 5 0
pot 6 0
wait 300
pot 5 0.02
pot 6 0.02
wait 200
# Hyp page: RATE up to ~1 kHz
tap b2
wait 300
pot 1 1
wait 300
pot 1 0
wait 300
pot 1 0.86
wait 1500
mark
wait 1000
expect rms > 0.05
expect finite
expect unclipped
# GAIN to the bottom, DAMP to the top: the ring stops
pot 3 1
wait 300
pot 3 0
pot 4 0
wait 300
pot 4 1
wait 2500
mark
wait 1000
expect rms < 0.01
# GAIN/DAMP back and a kick: alive again
pot 4 0.35
pot 3 0.45
wait 300
press b3
wait 50
tap b1
release b3
wait 2000
mark
wait 1000
expect rms > 0.05
expect finite
